      "column_id": "",
      "hint": "Monday's public GraphQL API does not currently expose a mutation for writing to time_tracking columns. Empirical probe (2026-05-10, API version 2026-01): change_simple_column_value rejects every candidate value with CorrectedValueException ("DurationColumn does not support simple column value writes"); change_column_value rejects every candidate JSON shape with InvalidColumnTypeException ("This column type is not supported yet in the API"); the mutation root has no time-tracking-related mutation. Use Monday's UI to start/stop time-tracking sessions until Monday ships API support — the verb is registered for forward-compatibility so agent scripts targeting \`monday item time-track start/stop\` are stable across the eventual swap.",
      "item_id": "12345",
